      "contract": "Each account transfer is all-or-nothing on real SQLite balances: debit then credit, with no negative balance. Missing source, missing destination or insufficient funds makes only that transfer fail. Later transfers and a caller continuation still run. An existing caller transaction, its earlier writes, and its right to roll back remain intact. Observe each transfer's success, balances and transaction state, then the continuation and caller rollback. No implementation source is supplied.",
